# The warehouse and the county archives are gigabytes and belong in object
# storage, not in a deployment. `/data/` is gitignored too, so a git-triggered
# build never sees it — this is the guard for `vercel deploy` run by hand from
# a working copy that has the files. Anchored with a leading slash: bare
# `data/` also matches `apps/web/src/app/data/`, which silently deleted the
# Data page — the one screen that drives ingest — from every deployment.
/data/
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.parquet

node_modules/
.turbo/
.next/
dist/
